% Tier FX (2026-09-16) — pure pass-through. All the real resolution (ERB
% props-hash scan, JSX prop-forwarding scan, component registry, one-hop
% local-assignment trace) happens in the "react_prop_urls" hub
% (internal/factpipe/hub_react_prop_urls.go); this rule only republishes its
% already-resolved fact under the emit relation's name.

react_prop_urls_patch_rel(ID, URL, Method, Label, OwnerService) :-
    react_prop_urls_patch(ID, URL, Method, Label, OwnerService).
